Font Awesome Free License — version 5.14.0

Font Awesome Free is free, open source, and GPL friendly.

Icons packaged as SVG and JS file types are licensed under CC BY 4.0. Font files, including the regular and solid TTF assets bundled with Gladius, are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Other non-font and non-icon files are licensed under MIT. Brand icons are trademarks of their respective owners.

The upstream distribution states that downloaded files contain embedded attribution comments. The full SIL Open Font License 1.1 text applicable to the bundled font files is included in COPYING.OFL. The upstream Font Awesome license summary is also available at the URL listed for this entry.
